    "title": "Watch: SEC Network's Gene Chizik previews LSU's week five matchup with Ole Miss - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Richie Mills ,\n1 hours ago\nNEW ORLEANS — No. 4 LSU will face No. 13 Ole Miss Saturday at 2:30 p.m. in Oxford.\nThe game will air on WGNO and ABC affiliates.\nFormer National Champion and currently SEC Network Analyst, Gene Chizik, previewed the upcoming matchup this week in the WGNO Sports Zone.\nYou can catch more college football coverage in the WGNO Sports Zone on Friday nights at 11 p.m. on Nola 38, the CW. The show replays Saturday mornings at 10:30 a.m. on WGNO.\nFor a full recap of all the action across the SEC, you can tune into Sports Zone Saturday Night Football.\nThe show follows the primetime matchup on WGNO, which will be No. 17 Alabama and No. 5 Georgia this weekend.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WGNO.",
